§§ `Article 49(3): deployers that are public authorities`

-- "deployers that are public authorities, Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies or persons acting on their behalf": a scope limit with no "only", so any other deployer gets NOTHING.
-- "shall register themselves, select the system and register its use": one subject, one database, one time: read as one act of registering (fork F-49-3-acts).
