         OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): no registration is required of this deployer on these facts

§§ `Article 49(4): the secure non-public section, what it holds, and who may see it`

-- The group of systems: "referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III, in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management". The points and the areas are both required (fork F-49-4-areas:
-- the other reading is that the areas merely describe the three points).
-- src:742 | 4. For high-risk AI systems referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III, in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management,
@ref Art 49(4) (src:742)
GIVEN `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` IS A NUMBER
      `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` MEANS
        (`the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` EQUALS 1 OR `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` EQUALS 6 OR `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` EQUALS 7)
    AND `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management`

-- src:742 | 4. For high-risk AI systems referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III, in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management, the registration referred to in paragraphs 1, 2 and 3 of this Article shall be in a secure non-public section of the EU database referred to in Article 71
@ref Art 49(4), the secure non-public section (src:742)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` IS A NUMBER
      `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 49(4) the registration must be in a secure non-public section of the EU database` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Art 113's general date has not come
    ELSE IF `Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "For high-risk AI systems referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III, in the areas of ..." (a scope limit with no "only")

-- "shall include only the following information, as applicable": a list the text closes with "only", so an item outside it gets JUST FALSE (the text's own no). Section A points 1 to 10 except 6, 8 and 9; Section B points 1 to 5 and 8 and 9;
-- Section C points 1 to 3; Annex IX points 1, 2, 3 and 5. "as applicable": whether an item applies to the system is the Annex's own condition (the Annex VIII functions below), not asked again here.
-- Section B has two versions: the Omnibus deleted points 7 and 9, so as amended the paragraph's "point 9" names a point that is no longer there: NOTHING (the text shows it deleted).
-- src:743 | (a) Section A, points 1 to 10, of Annex VIII, with the exception of points 6, 8 and 9;
@ref Art 49(4)(a) (src:743)
GIVEN `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` MEANS
    IF `the point of the Annex` AT LEAST 1 AND `the point of the Annex` AT MOST 13
    THEN JUST (       `the point of the Annex` AT MOST 10
                  AND NOT (`the point of the Annex` EQUALS 6 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 8 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 9))  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall include only the following information"
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Section A of Annex VIII has no such point

-- src:744 | (b) Section B, points 1 to 5, and points 8 and 9 of Annex VIII;
@ref Art 49(4)(b), as enacted (src:744)
GIVEN `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 49(4)(b) as enacted the Section B point is within the restricted registration` MEANS
    IF `the point of the Annex` AT LEAST 1 AND `the point of the Annex` AT MOST 9
    THEN JUST (`the point of the Annex` AT MOST 5 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 8 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 9)  -- VERSION as enacted. FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall include only the following information"
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Section B of Annex VIII as enacted has no such point

-- src:744 | (b) Section B, points 1 to 5, and points 8 and 9 of Annex VIII;
@ref Art 49(4)(b), as amended (src:744)
GIVEN `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 49(4)(b) as amended the Section B point is within the restricted registration` MEANS
    IF `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 7 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 9
    THEN NOTHING  -- VERSION as amended. NOTHING-kind (repealed or blank in this text): points 7 and 9 of Section B are deleted by the Omnibus (consolidated lines 1865 and 1869); the paragraph still names point 9
    ELSE IF `the point of the Annex` AT LEAST 1 AND `the point of the Annex` AT MOST 8
         THEN JUST (`the point of the Annex` AT MOST 5 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 8)  -- VERSION as amended. FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall include only the following information"
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Section B of Annex VIII as amended has no such point

-- src:745 | (c) Section C, points 1 to 3, of Annex VIII;
@ref Art 49(4)(c) (src:745)
GIVEN `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 49(4)(c) the Section C point is within the restricted registration` MEANS
    IF `the point of the Annex` AT LEAST 1 AND `the point of the Annex` AT MOST 5
    THEN JUST (`the point of the Annex` AT MOST 3)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall include only the following information"
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Section C of Annex VIII has no such point

-- src:746 | (d) points 1, 2, 3 and 5, of Annex IX.
@ref Art 49(4)(d) (src:746)
GIVEN `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 49(4)(d) the Annex IX point is within the restricted registration` MEANS
    IF `the point of the Annex` AT LEAST 1 AND `the point of the Annex` AT MOST 5
    THEN JUST (`the point of the Annex` EQUALS 1 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 2 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 3 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 5)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall include only the following information"
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Annex IX has no such point

-- src:742 | 4. For high-risk AI systems referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III, in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management, the registration referred to in paragraphs 1, 2 and 3 of this Article shall be in a secure non-public section of the EU database referred to in Article 71 and shall include only the following information, as applicable, referred to in:
-- src:743 | (a) Section A, points 1 to 10, of Annex VIII, with the exception of points 6, 8 and 9;
-- src:744 | (b) Section B, points 1 to 5, and points 8 and 9 of Annex VIII;
-- src:745 | (c) Section C, points 1 to 3, of Annex VIII;
-- src:746 | (d) points 1, 2, 3 and 5, of Annex IX.
@ref Art 49(4) first subparagraph, the information (src:742-746)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` IS A NUMBER
      `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the part of the registration` IS A `Art 49(4) part`
      `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 49(4) the information item is included in the restricted registration` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Art 113's general date has not come
    ELSE IF NOT `Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management`
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph speaks of systems referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in those areas (a scope limit with no "only")
         ELSE CONSIDER `the part of the registration`
              WHEN `Art 49(4) Annex VIII Section A` THEN `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` `the point of the Annex`
              WHEN `Art 49(4) Annex VIII Section B` THEN
                  CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
                  WHEN `as enacted` THEN `Art 49(4)(b) as enacted the Section B point is within the restricted registration` `the point of the Annex`  -- VERSION as enacted
                  WHEN `as amended` THEN `Art 49(4)(b) as amended the Section B point is within the restricted registration` `the point of the Annex`  -- VERSION as amended
              WHEN `Art 49(4) Annex VIII Section C` THEN `Art 49(4)(c) the Section C point is within the restricted registration` `the point of the Annex`
              WHEN `Art 49(4) Annex IX` THEN `Art 49(4)(d) the Annex IX point is within the restricted registration` `the point of the Annex`

-- src:747 | Only the Commission and national authorities referred to in Article 74(8) shall have access to the respective restricted sections of the EU database listed in the first subparagraph of this paragraph.
@ref Art 49(4) second subparagraph (src:747)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the person is the Commission` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a national authority referred to in Article 74(8)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 49(4) the person has access to the restricted sections of the EU database` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Art 113's general date has not come
    ELSE IF `the person is the Commission` OR `the person is a national authority referred to in Article 74(8)`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Only the Commission and national authorities referred to in Article 74(8) shall have access"

§§ `Article 49(5): systems referred to in point 2 of Annex III`

-- "shall be registered at national level": the text does not say by whom (an existence function, and no rule: NOTES.md, Jural relations).
-- src:748 | 5. High-risk AI systems referred to in point 2 of Annex III shall be registered at national level.
@ref Art 49(5) (src:748)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 49(5) the high-risk AI system must be registered at national level` MEANS
    IF (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` 49 5)
    THEN JUST FALSE  -- S14-kind (a list closed by "only"): Article 2(2), "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply" to a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products (fork F-S14-reach)
    ELSE IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply to the high-risk AI system on the date asked` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Art 113's general date has not come, or Art 111(2) saves the system
         ELSE IF `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` EQUALS 2
              THEN JUST TRUE
              ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "High-risk AI systems referred to in point 2 of Annex III" (a scope limit with no "only")

§ `Annex VIII: the information to be submitted upon registration`

-- Each Section says "The following information shall be provided and thereafter kept up to date": the two verbs are one duty here (provide, then keep up to date), asked as one question. The points are numbered in the text,
-- so a point is asked by its number. A point that opens with "Where" or is qualified "where applicable" is required only where the condition holds (JUST FALSE where it does not: reading (b)); point 12 of Section A is
-- "not provided" for the systems of points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management (a flat negative: JUST FALSE); point 13 is "(optional)" (JUST FALSE: not required).
-- A number that is not a point of the Section gets NOTHING.
-- src:1843 | The following information shall be provided and thereafter kept up to date with regard to high-risk AI systems to be registered in accordance with Article 49(1):
-- src:1844 | 1. The name, address and contact details of the provider;
-- src:1845 | 2. Where submission of information is carried out by another person on behalf of the provider, the name, address and contact details of that person;
-- src:1846 | 3. The name, address and contact details of the authorised representative, where applicable;
-- src:1847 | 4. The AI system trade name and any additional unambiguous reference allowing the identification and traceability of the AI system;
-- src:1848 | 5. A description of the intended purpose of the AI system and of the components and functions supported through this AI system;
-- src:1849 | 6. A basic and concise description of the information used by the system (data, inputs) and its operating logic;
-- src:1850 | 7. The status of the AI system (on the market, or in service; no longer placed on the market/in service, recalled);
-- src:1851 | 8. The type, number and expiry date of the certificate issued by the notified body and the name or identification number of that notified body, where applicable;
-- src:1852 | 9. A scanned copy of the certificate referred to in point 8, where applicable;
-- src:1853 | 10. Any Member States in which the AI system has been placed on the market, put into service or made available in the Union;
-- src:1854 | 11. A copy of the EU declaration of conformity referred to in Article 47;
-- src:1855 | 12. Electronic instructions for use; this information shall not be provided for high-risk AI systems in the areas of law enforcement or migration, asylum and border control management referred to in Annex III, points 1, 6 and 7;
-- src:1856 | 13. A URL for additional information (optional).
@ref Annex VIII Section A (src:1843-1856)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
      `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` IS A NUMBER
      `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` IS A BOOLEAN
      `another person submits the information on behalf of the provider` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an authorised representative applies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a certificate has been issued by a notified body` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex VIII Section A the information at the point must be provided and kept up to date` MEANS
    IF (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` 49 0)
    THEN JUST FALSE  -- S14-kind (a list closed by "only"): Article 2(2), "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply" to a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products (fork F-S14-reach)
    ELSE IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply to the high-risk AI system on the date asked` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Art 113's general date has not come, or Art 111(2) saves the system
         ELSE IF NOT (`the point of the Annex` AT LEAST 1 AND `the point of the Annex` AT MOST 13)
              THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Section A has no such point
              ELSE IF `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 2
                   THEN JUST `another person submits the information on behalf of the provider`  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where submission of information is carried out by another person on behalf of the provider" (reading (b))
                   ELSE IF `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 3
                        THEN JUST `an authorised representative applies`  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "where applicable" (reading (b))
                        ELSE IF `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 8 OR `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 9
                             THEN JUST `a certificate has been issued by a notified body`  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "where applicable" (reading (b))
                             ELSE IF `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 12
                                  THEN JUST (NOT (`Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management`))  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "this information shall not be provided for high-risk AI systems in the areas of law enforcement or migration, asylum and border control management referred to in Annex III, points 1, 6 and 7"
                                  ELSE IF `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 13
                                       THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A URL for additional information (optional)": not required
                                       ELSE JUST TRUE

