-- src:1858 | The following information shall be provided and thereafter kept up to date with regard to AI systems to be registered in accordance with Article 49(2):
-- src:1859 | 1. The name, address and contact details of the provider;
-- src:1860 | 2. Where submission of information is carried out by another person on behalf of the provider, the name, address and contact details of that person;
-- src:1861 | 3. The name, address and contact details of the authorised representative, where applicable;
-- src:1862 | 4. The AI system trade name and any additional unambiguous reference allowing the identification and traceability of the AI system;
-- src:1863 | 5. A description of the intended purpose of the AI system;
-- src:1864 | 6. The condition or conditions under Article 6(3)based on which the AI system is considered to be not-high-risk;
-- src:1865 | ▼M1 DELETED
-- src:1868 | 8. The status of the AI system (on the market, or in service; no longer placed on the market/in service, recalled).
-- src:1869 | ▼M1 DELETED
