-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:2618 | 9.
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:2619 | Any Member States in which the AI system has been placed on the market, put into service or made available in the Union.
@ref Annex VIII Section B, both versions (src:1858-1869) (src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:2601-2619)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
      `another person submits the information on behalf of the provider` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an authorised representative applies` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex VIII Section B the information at the point must be provided and kept up to date` MEANS
    IF (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` 49 0)
    THEN JUST FALSE  -- S14-kind (a list closed by "only"): Article 2(2), "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply" to a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products (fork F-S14-reach)
    ELSE IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply to the high-risk AI system on the date asked` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Art 113's general date has not come, or Art 111(2) saves the system
         ELSE CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
              WHEN `as enacted` THEN `Annex VIII Section B as enacted the information at the point must be provided and kept up to date` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the point of the Annex` `another person submits the information on behalf of the provider` `an authorised representative applies`  -- VERSION as enacted
              WHEN `as amended` THEN `Annex VIII Section B as amended the information at the point must be provided and kept up to date` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the point of the Annex` `another person submits the information on behalf of the provider` `an authorised representative applies`  -- VERSION as amended

-- src:1873 | The following information shall be provided and thereafter kept up to date with regard to high-risk AI systems to be registered in accordance with Article 49(3):
-- src:1874 | 1. The name, address and contact details of the deployer;
-- src:1875 | 2. The name, address and contact details of the person submitting information on behalf of the deployer;
-- src:1876 | 3. The URL of the entry of the AI system in the EU database by its provider;
-- src:1877 | 4. A summary of the findings of the fundamental rights impact assessment conducted in accordance with Article 27;
-- src:1878 | 5. A summary of the data protection impact assessment carried out in accordance with Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680 as specified in Article 26(8) of this Regulation, where applicable.
@ref Annex VIII Section C (src:1873-1878)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
      `a data protection impact assessment has been carried out in accordance with Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex VIII Section C the information at the point must be provided and kept up to date` MEANS
    IF (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` 49 0)
    THEN JUST FALSE  -- S14-kind (a list closed by "only"): Article 2(2), "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply" to a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products (fork F-S14-reach)
    ELSE IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply to the high-risk AI system on the date asked` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Art 113's general date has not come, or Art 111(2) saves the system
         ELSE IF NOT (`the point of the Annex` AT LEAST 1 AND `the point of the Annex` AT MOST 5)
              THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Section C has no such point
              ELSE IF `the point of the Annex` EQUALS 5
                   THEN JUST `a data protection impact assessment has been carried out in accordance with Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680`  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "where applicable" (reading (b))
                   ELSE JUST TRUE

§ `Annex IX: information on testing in real world conditions`

-- Annex IX does not say who provides the information; Article 60(4)(c) (another part's) puts the registration of the testing on the provider or prospective provider, so the duty is read as theirs (fork F-IX-bearer).
-- No placing on the market has happened before testing in real world conditions, so Art 111(2) has nothing to save: the date only.
-- src:1881 | The following information shall be provided and thereafter kept up to date with regard to testing in real world conditions to be registered in accordance with Article 60:
-- src:1882 | 1. A Union-wide unique single identification number of the testing in real world conditions;
-- src:1883 | 2. The name and contact details of the provider or prospective provider and of the deployers involved in the testing in real world conditions;
-- src:1884 | 3. A brief description of the AI system, its intended purpose, and other information necessary for the identification of the system;
-- src:1885 | 4. A summary of the main characteristics of the plan for testing in real world conditions;
-- src:1886 | 5. Information on the suspension or termination of the testing in real world conditions.
@ref Annex IX (src:1881-1886)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex IX the information at the point must be provided and kept up to date` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Art 113's general date has not come
    ELSE IF `the point of the Annex` AT LEAST 1 AND `the point of the Annex` AT MOST 5
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Annex IX has no such point

§ `Article 49 and Annexes VIII and IX: the regulative rules`

DECLARE `Annex VIII act` IS ONE OF
    `Annex VIII Section A provide the information at the point and keep it up to date`
    `Annex VIII Section B provide the information at the point and keep it up to date`
    `Annex VIII Section C provide the information at the point and keep it up to date`
    `Annex IX provide the information at the point and keep it up to date`

-- Article 49(1) to (3): the registration is due "before placing on the market or putting into service" (or "before putting into service or using"): a time limit, so a breach path. Time 0 of a trace is the date asked;
-- the limit is the days from the date asked to the date of placing on the market. A date asked after that date gives a limit already passed (any trace reads BREACH); "has the registration been made in time" is answered by the functions above.
@ref Art 49(1)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the high-risk AI system is listed in Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` IS A NUMBER
      `an authorised representative applies` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 49 act`
`Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 49(1) who must register themselves and their system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the high-risk AI system is listed in Annex III` `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` `an authorised representative applies`
    WHEN JUST `Art 49 the provider` THEN
        PARTY Provider
        MUST `Art 49(1) register themselves and their system in the EU database`
        WITHIN (Day `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`) MINUS (Day `the date asked`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY Provider BECAUSE "the provider did not register themselves and their system in the EU database before placing the system on the market or putting it into service"
    WHEN JUST `Art 49 the authorised representative` THEN
        PARTY `Authorised representative`
        MUST `Art 49(1) register themselves and their system in the EU database`
        WITHIN (Day `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`) MINUS (Day `the date asked`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Authorised representative` BECAUSE "the authorised representative did not register themselves and the system in the EU database before the system was placed on the market or put into service"
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

@ref Art 49(2)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the provider has concluded that the AI system is not high-risk according to Article 6(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an authorised representative applies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the AI system is to be placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 49 act`
`Art 49(2) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 49(2) who must register themselves and the AI system` `the date asked` `the provider has concluded that the AI system is not high-risk according to Article 6(3)` `an authorised representative applies`
    WHEN JUST `Art 49 the provider` THEN
        PARTY Provider
        MUST `Art 49(2) register themselves and the AI system in the EU database`
        WITHIN (Day `the date the AI system is to be placed on the market or put into service`) MINUS (Day `the date asked`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY Provider BECAUSE "the provider did not register themselves and the AI system in the EU database before placing the system on the market or putting it into service"
    WHEN JUST `Art 49 the authorised representative` THEN
        PARTY `Authorised representative`
        MUST `Art 49(2) register themselves and the AI system in the EU database`
        WITHIN (Day `the date the AI system is to be placed on the market or put into service`) MINUS (Day `the date asked`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Authorised representative` BECAUSE "the authorised representative did not register themselves and the AI system in the EU database before the system was placed on the market or put into service"
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

@ref Art 49(3)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the high-risk AI system is listed in Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` IS A NUMBER
      `the deployer is a public authority, a Union institution, body, office or agency, or a person acting on their behalf` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date on which the deployer puts the high-risk AI system into service or uses it` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 49 act`
`Art 49(3) the deployer's duty to register before putting into service or using` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 49(3) the deployer must register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the high-risk AI system is listed in Annex III` `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` `the deployer is a public authority, a Union institution, body, office or agency, or a person acting on their behalf`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
        PARTY Deployer
        MUST `Art 49(3) register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database`
        WITHIN (Day `the date on which the deployer puts the high-risk AI system into service or uses it`) MINUS (Day `the date asked`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY Deployer BECAUSE "the deployer did not register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database before putting the system into service or using it"
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

-- Article 49(4): where the registration must be made. The text names no bearer ("shall be in a secure non-public section"); the person who registers is the provider (or the authorised representative), so the rule is the provider's
-- and no time limit is stated: no breach path (fork F-49-4-bearer).
@ref Art 49(4) first subparagraph
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` IS A NUMBER
      `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 49 act`
`Art 49(4) the provider's duty to register in the secure non-public section` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 49(4) the registration must be in a secure non-public section of the EU database` `the date asked` `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN PARTY Provider MUST `Art 49(4) make the registration in a secure non-public section of the EU database`
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

-- Annex VIII Sections A to C and Annex IX: the duty to provide the information and to keep it up to date. No time limit and no consequence of its own: no breach path.
@ref Annex VIII Section A
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the point of the Annex` IS A NUMBER
      `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` IS A NUMBER
      `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` IS A BOOLEAN
      `another person submits the information on behalf of the provider` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an authorised representative applies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a certificate has been issued by a notified body` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Annex VIII act`
`Annex VIII Section A the provider's duty to provide the information at the point and keep it up to date` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Annex VIII Section A the information at the point must be provided and kept up to date` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the point of the Annex` `the point of Annex III under which the high-risk AI system is listed` `the high-risk AI system is in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` `another person submits the information on behalf of the provider` `an authorised representative applies` `a certificate has been issued by a notified body`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN PARTY Provider MUST `Annex VIII Section A provide the information at the point and keep it up to date`
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

@ref Annex VIII Section B
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
